  <name>Silent Client</name>
  <summary>Free Minecraft launcher for 1.8.9 PvP</summary>
  <description>
    <p>Silent Client is a free Minecraft launcher built for 1.8.9 PvP, made for players who want the highest frame rates and a clean, fast client.</p>
    <p>Your machine runs as fast as it can, more than 40 mods are built in, and the HUD can be dragged and customized until the screen looks exactly the way you want it.</p>
    <p>Cosmetics, game files and Java are handled for you. You do not need a paid Minecraft account, offline mode works too.</p>
    <p>Over a million players use Silent Client, on Windows, macOS and Linux.</p>
    <p>This Flatpak is built and maintained by the Silent Client team.</p>
  </description>
